    {
      "id": "msg_0635_T30R0601_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Um...\n",
        "Who did you say I was again?\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Oh, yes, I remember now!\n",
        "I’m the Move Deleter!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0635_T30R0601_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "You’ve come to make me force your\n",
        "Pokémon to forget some moves? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0635_T30R0601_00002",
      "en_US": "Which Pokémon should forget a move?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0635_T30R0601_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Remember me if there are moves that\n",
        "need to be forgotten."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0635_T30R0601_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "That Pokémon knows only one move,\n",
        "so it can’t be forgotten...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0635_T30R0601_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "What? That’s an Egg.\n",
        "No Egg should know any moves.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0635_T30R0601_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "OK, then.\n",
        "Which move should be forgotten?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0635_T30R0601_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Hm! The move {STRVAR_1 6, 0, 0}?\n",
        "Should that move be forgotten? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0635_T30R0601_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "It worked perfectly!\r",
        "Your Pokémon has forgotten the move\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 6, 0, 0} completely."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0635_T30R0601_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Me?\n",
        "I’m the Pokémon Move Maniac.\r",
        "I know every move that Pokémon learn\n",
        "while they’re leveling up, and I can\f",
        "make Pokémon remember those moves.\r",
        "I can make a Pokémon of yours remember\n",
        "a move if you’d like.\r",
        "But...ahem! It’ll cost you.\r",
        "I’ll make a Pokémon remember a move\n",
        "if you’ll trade me a Heart Scale."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0635_T30R0601_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Ha! That’s it! That’s an honest-to-\n",
        "goodness Heart Scale!\r",
        "Let me guess, you want me to teach\n",
        "one of your Pokémon a move?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0635_T30R0601_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "If any of your Pokémon needs to learn a\n",
        "move, come back with a Heart Scale."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0635_T30R0601_00012",
      "en_US": "Which Pokémon needs tutoring?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0635_T30R0601_00013",
      "en_US": "Which move should I make it remember?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0635_T30R0601_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Sorry...\r",
        "There isn’t any move I can make\n",
        "that Pokémon remember."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0635_T30R0601_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Hunh?\r",
        "Don’t you think it’d be tough for\n",
        "an Egg to remember a move?\r",
        "It’s not even hatched."
      ]
    },
