    {
      "id": "msg_0635_T30R0601_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "Hohoho...\n",
        "They call me Grandma Wilma.\r",
        "I sense a slight talent as a\n",
        "Dragon Tamer in you.\r",
        "Would you like me to teach a move\n",
        "to one of your Pokémon? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0635_T30R0601_00027",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, it is you again...\r",
        "Would you like me to teach the best\n",
        "Dragon-type move I know to one of\f",
        "your Pokémon? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0635_T30R0601_00028",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, perhaps if you change your\n",
        "mind, do come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0635_T30R0601_00029",
      "en_US": [
        "I see...\n",
        "I like your sense of adventure.\r",
        "However, none of the Pokémon with\n",
        "you now can learn the move."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0635_T30R0601_00030",
      "en_US": [
